        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Barrister in Hong Kong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short visual novel set in Hong Kong where you play as Barbara, a newly minted barrister. This game is quite short, you can probably play through it in about two hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two cases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels of court appearances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two levels adventure game style  investigating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice music</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barbara</strong> - The main character, the person you play as. Barbara has just been ceritified as a barrister and is about to do her first case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sundeep -</strong> Your boss. Sundeep is a renowned barrister who guides you through your court cases and investigations. Sometimes he gets distracted, but that just means you have more responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Korshal -</strong> Your client. Sundeep told you he was involved in a traffic dispute, but it turns out he is actually accused of committing a murder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jared -</strong> Someone who witnessed your client committing the murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nelson -</strong> The prosecuting barrister. Nelson is trying to get your client charged with murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Judge Karen -</strong> The judge who presides over both court cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audrey -</strong> The victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Barrister in Hong Kong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short visual novel set in Hong Kong where you play as Barbara, a newly minted barrister. This game is quite short, you can probably play through it in about two hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two cases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels of court appearances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two levels adventure game style  investigating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice music</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barbara</strong> - The main character, the person you play as. Barbara has just been ceritified as a barrister and is about to do her first case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sundeep -</strong> Your boss. Sundeep is a renowned barrister who guides you through your court cases and investigations. Sometimes he gets distracted, but that just means you have more responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Korshal -</strong> Your client. Sundeep told you he was involved in a traffic dispute, but it turns out he is actually accused of committing a murder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jared -</strong> Someone who witnessed your client committing the murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nelson -</strong> The prosecuting barrister. Nelson is trying to get your client charged with murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Judge Karen -</strong> The judge who presides over both court cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audrey -</strong> The victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
